Subject to Article 8.1, the licensor shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential or punitive damages, including but not limited to damages for loss of profits, goodwill, use, data or other intangible losses, even if the licensor has been advised of the possibility of such damages, arising out of this Licence or the use of or inability to use the work.

