Article 10 – Acceptance of the Licence

The provisions of this Licence can be accepted by clicking on an "I agree" button at the bottom of a window displaying the text of this Licence or by any other means which results in any clear affirmative action indicating acceptance of this Licence.

Article 11 – Information to the public

